{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_schemaregistry", "label": "SchemaRegistry (Interface)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-registry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Optionaler zentraler Katalog: in grossen Codebases wird 'zu wissen, was existiert' selbst zum Problem, weil Versionen, Codecs und Upcaster in den Adapter-Configs verstreut liegen. Erst ab ~10 Event-Typen lohnend."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_inmemoryschemaregistry", "label": "InMemorySchemaRegistry", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-registry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Die ausgelieferte Implementierung; haelt den gesamten State in einem Prozess. Als Konstante pro Deployment behandeln - unterschiedliche Umgebungen spiegeln sich im deployten Code, nicht in verschiedenen Laufzeit-Registries."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_schemaregistration", "label": "SchemaRegistration", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-registry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_zodcodec", "label": "zodCodec", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-registry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_serializercodec", "label": "serializerCodec", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-registry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Kodiert zu { serializerId, manifest, bytes } und hoert da auf - der Payload-Codec des Journals traegt ein Uint8Array bereits als getaggtes JSON, die Bytes werden also genau einmal base64-kodiert."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_compatibility_checks", "label": "Kompatibilitaets-Checks (none / backward / sample)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-registry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Register-Zeit statt Deploy-Zeit: eine Version hochziehen und den Upcaster vergessen laesst die Registrierung laut fehlschlagen. 'sample' faehrt zusaetzlich einen Round-Trip (alter Codec dekodieren, upcasten, neuer Codec enkodieren) und erwischt latente Upcaster-Bugs."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_registry_eventadapter", "label": "registry.eventAdapter(manifest)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-registry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Schreibt bei der neuesten registrierten Version und dekodiert beim Lesen jedes gespeicherte Event mit dem Codec seiner eigenen Version, bevor es die Upcaster nach vorne verkettet."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_registry_snapshotadapter", "label": "registry.snapshotAdapter(manifest)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-registry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_latestversion", "label": "latestVersion(manifest)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-registry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_per_version_wire_format", "label": "Ein binaeres Wire-Format pro Version", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-registry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Die einzige Stelle, an der ein Formatwechsel pro Version geht: withSerializer(...) eines Stores gilt storeweit. Avro-Zeilen auf der Platte dekodieren weiter ueber den v1-Codec, neue Events gehen als Protobuf - beide Formate koexistieren in einem Stream."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_serializerid_mismatch_detection", "label": "serializerId-Mismatch macht eine Verwechslung laut", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-registry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Die serializerId reist mit der Zeile mit. Ohne sie waere stilles Dekodieren zu Unsinn der Normalfall - Avro hat keine Feld-Tags, Protobuf keinen Nachrichtennamen."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_not_a_remote_schema_registry", "label": "Keine Remote-/HTTP-Schema-Registry", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-registry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Keine Remote-Subject-Versionierung und keine Kompatibilitaets-Aushandlung ueber die Leitung - ausserhalb des Scopes fuer v1. Das strukturelle Schema ist trotzdem hier: jedes (manifest, version) traegt einen Codec, erzwungen auf Lesen und Schreiben."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_inmemoryschemaregistry", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_schemaregistry", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-registry.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_schemaregistry", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_schemaregistration", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-registry.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_schemaregistration", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_zodcodec", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-registry.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_schemaregistration", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_serializercodec", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-registry.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_schemaregistry", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_registry_eventadapter", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-regi